eneck Bros - HBM &gt; TSMC &gt; ASML &gt; Carl Zeiss https://t.co/aKGbebmkOz", "url": "https://x.com/tevcapital/status/2115978064127824364"}, {"author_id": "2050576264717586433", "created_at": "2026-10-29T04:28:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115661965355786509"], "id": "2115661965355786509", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🚨 Samsung: 2027 HBM kapasitesi şimdiden tamamen satıldı\n\nSamsung bilanço görüşmesindeki yeni ayrıntıya göre HBM4 satışları çeyreklik bazda üç kattan fazla arttı ve toplam HBM satışlarının %60'ına ulaştı. Şirketin 2027 HBM üretiminin tamamı anlaşılmış fiyatlarla satıldı;", "url": "https://x.com/PipMomentTr/status/2115661965355786509"}, {"author_id": "960804070117187584", "created_at": "2026-10-29T11:40:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115770761931899354"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/sffepXslgp", "end": 112, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/paurooteri/status/2115770761931899354/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115770615839989760", "start": 89, "url": "https://t.co/sffepXslgp"}]}, "id": "2115770761931899354", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 17929, "like_count": 63, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 6}, "text": "FormFactor\n大口顧客の割合\nHBM向けのSK  Hynixの割合は少し下がり、CoWoSのTSMCが上昇\nおそらくNVIDIAも10％弱で買いまくっていると思うけどね https://t.co/sffepXslgp", "url": "https://x.com/paurooteri/status/2115770761931899354"}, {"author_id": "1828694705506500608", "created_at": "2026-10-30T20:19:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116263754363244559"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/eozwUql6dm", "end": 302, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/JSCC2020Lee/status/2116263754363244559/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116263681168400385", "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/eozwUql6dm"}]}, "id": "2116263754363244559", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 30, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Memory is on track to be ~62% of all chip revenue in 2027, per TechInsights.\n\n• The Event: TechInsights' 2027 outlook plus October DRAMeXchange prices.\n• Direct Winner: memory makers selling into an AI-driven shortage.\n\n1/ Key Numbers &amp; Facts:\n• 2027 chip market: &gt;$2.6T; https://t.co/eozwUql6dm", "url": "https://x.com/JSCC2020Lee/status/2116263754363244559"}, {"author_id": "1005714066722127873", "created_at": "2026-10-29T00:32:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115602555422245011"], "id": "2115602555422245011", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 92, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "What if the AI race is not about who builds the best model, but about who gets to build at all? Anthropic's S-1 says tight TSMC capacity already kept it from getting enough chips on time. That is not a footnote. It means the bottleneck in this cycle is allocation: fabs, CoWoS", "url": "https://x.com/CHek_lee/status/2115602555422245011"}, {"author_id": "1258887085873868802", "created_at": "2026-10-29T05:36:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115679117672599960"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 83, "start": 78, "tag": "ASML"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/HfdKAHXm2G", "end": 301, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/peachypuffbun/status/2115679117672599960/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115679073884098560", "start": 278, "url": "https://t.co/HfdKAHXm2G"}]}, "id": "2115679117672599960", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "whenever the market argues about models or compute oversupply, i just look at $ASML. latest is advanced litho queues might stretch all the way to 2028. tsmc ramping 2nm, memory giants stacking hbm, everyone literally relies on asml to ship euvs .as long as tech pushes physical https://t.co/HfdKAHXm2G", "url": "https://x.com/peachypuffbun/status/2115679117672599960"}, {"author_id": "1828694705506500608", "created_at": "2026-10-29T23:45:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115953298415223203"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/t2cLyVJyG8", "end": 301, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/JSCC2020Lee/status/2115953298415223203/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115953292887130112", "start": 278, "url": "https://t.co/t2cLyVJyG8"}]}, "id": "2115953298415223203", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 226, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "NVIDIA Spectrum-X Photonics CPO switches enter production as optical-engine capacity targets 15x expansion by mid-2027 with volume ramp in 2027-2028.\n1/ Key Numbers &amp; Facts: • NVIDIA-SPIL optical-engine capacity: 15x by mid-2027, further doubling by end-2028 (~30x total) • https://t.co/t2cLyVJyG8", "url": "https://x.com/JSCC2020Lee/status/2115953298415223203"}, {"author_id": "1883321599153373185", "created_at": "2026-10-29T04:28:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115661954152911106"], "id": "2115661954152911106", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 17, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🚨 Samsung: 2027 HBM capacity already fully sold out\n\nAccording to a new detail from Samsung's earnings call, HBM4 sales more than tripled quarter-on-quarter, reaching 60% of total HBM sales. The company's entire 2027 HBM output has been sold at agreed prices, with customers", "url": "https://x.com/pipmoment/status/2115661954152911106"}, {"author_id": "785856172209373184", "created_at": "2026-10-29T09:12:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115733442344493524"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/iWVoJXjZLq", "end": 299, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Rutowi_/status/2115733442344493524/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115733439903408128", "start": 276, "url": "https://t.co/iWVoJXjZLq"}]}, "id": "2115733442344493524", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 57, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "☕ Ce qu’il fallait retenir hier sur l’IA et les semi-conducteurs — 28 octobre 2026 ↓\n\n1) Nvidia / Antitrust — le DOJ s’intéresse à l’acquisition de Hugging Face\n\nReuters révèle que le Département de la Justice a adressé des demandes d’information sur le rachat d’Hugging Face https://t.co/iWVoJXjZLq", "url": "https://x.com/Rutowi_/status/2115733442344493524"}, {"article": {"title": "AI Infrastructure Bottleneck Ranking"}, "author_id": "1621797506270236672", "created_at": "2026-10-29T15:44:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115832133994348723"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/i/article/2115…", "end": 23, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2115830460328632320", "start": 0, "status": 404, "unwound_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2115830460328632320", "url": "https://t.co/ma32LMLHsI"}]}, "id": "2115832133994348723", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 24, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/ma32LMLHsI", "url": "https://x.com/simplyprobe/status/2115832133994348723"}, {"author_id": "915580080432148482", "created_at": "2026-10-30T15:02:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116183855266942998"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/ApxlwuJbP9", "end": 304, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/anton_d_leicht/status/2116183855266942998/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116183850846191616", "start": 281, "url": "https://t.co/ApxlwuJbP9"}]}, "id": "2116183855266942998", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 11, "impression_count": 1814, "like_count": 41, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 7}, "text": "Semiconductor chokepoints are huge strategic assets: Taiwan is building its Silicon Shield, Korea is near-untouchable due to HBM, America is building AGI with Nvidia chips.\n\nYet despite ASML, Europe captures little AI value and even less strategic leverage. Why?\n\n(1) No BATNA. If https://t.co/ApxlwuJbP9", "url": "https://x.com/anton_d_leicht/status/2116183855266942998"}, {"author_id": "178396704", "created_at": "2026-10-30T15:09:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116185774689333635"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 11, "start": 6, "tag": "INTC"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/IngJuanPa7/sta…", "end": 291, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/IngJuanPa7/status/2115899190941565152", "start": 268, "url": "https://t.co/qqL0KXLz1E"}]}, "id": "2116185774689333635", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 586, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115899190941565152", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Intel $INTC se desploma cerca de un 29% y se encamina hacia la peor sesión bursátil de su historia, con una pérdida potencial de más de 137.000 millones de dólares en capitalización. La caída está arrastrando al conjunto del sector de semiconductores, en medio de las https://t.co/qqL0KXLz1E", "url": "https://x.com/IngJuanPa7/status/2116185774689333635"}, {"article": {"title": "Bellek döngüsü: 2027 kıtlık, 2028 arz dalgası mı?"}, "author_id": "1858245614397685760", "created_at": "2026-10-30T09:31:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116100783200477374"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/i/article/2116…", "end": 92, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2116098311241232384", "start": 69, "status": 404, "unwound_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2116098311241232384", "url": "https://t.co/Lge9CAYXFS"}]}, "id": "2116100783200477374", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 85, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Bellek çiplerinde sıradaki dalga: 2027'de kıtlık, 2028'de bolluk mu? https://t.co/Lge9CAYXFS", "url": "https://x.com/submarinetrader/status/2116100783200477374"}, {"author_id": "1270850183270563840", "created_at": "2026-10-30T08:06:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116079247676879112"], "id": "2116079247676879112", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 9804, "like_count": 37, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "【レーザーテック決算、コンセンサス44%未達。AI半導体需要に陰りなのか？】\n\n2027年6月期1Q経常利益は147億円。市場予想263億円を約44%下回る厳しい内容。\n\nただし、今回の未達をAI半導体需要の減速と直結させるのは早計では？\n\n■ 決算内容を詳しく見ると\n　※生産は伸びている", "url": "https://x.com/semicon_eng1/status/2116079247676879112"}, {"author_id": "973200602", "created_at": "2026-10-30T00:50:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115969445327954233"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "SynopsysとTSMCは、先端半導体設計分野での協業を拡大する。TSMCの「A14」プロセス向けEDAフローを整備したほか、エージェント型AIを活用してアナログ／デジタル／マルチダイ設計の自動化を進める。先端パッケージング技術「CoWoS」を用いたマルチダイ設計や、「N2P」プロセス向けIP（Intellectual Property）の拡充にも取り組む。", "display_url": "eetimes.itmedia.co.jp/ee/articles/26…", "end": 88, "expanded_url": "https://eetimes.itmedia.co.jp/ee/articles/2609/30/news059.html", "images": [{"height": 418, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115969452244373505/E1T2UYZx?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 800}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115969452244373505/E1T2UYZx?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 65, "status": 200, "title": "TSMC「A14」設計にエージェントAI、Synopsysと協業", "unwound_url": "https://eetimes.itmedia.co.jp/ee/articles/2609/30/news059.html", "url": "https://t.co/F83Ivga7Oo"}]}, "id": "2115969445327954233", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 26, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "TSMC「A14」設計にエージェントAI、Synopsysと協業：CoWoS向け設計やIPでも - EE Times Japan https://t.co/F83Ivga7Oo", "url": "https://x.com/giw_news/status/2115969445327954233"}, {"author_id": "1276975724751212545", "created_at": "2026-10-30T18:39:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116238580385185883"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 203, "id": "499993648", "start": 191, "username": "Beth_Kindig"}]}, "id": "2116238580385185883", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 90, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "\"📰 TSMC is reportedly planning to raise CoWoS packaging prices by up to 20% next year, Beth Kindig reports.\nPackaging demand keeps growing across GPUs, server CPUs and custom silicon.\" — via @Beth_Kindig", "url": "https://x.com/Joshuatrader1/status/2116238580385185883"}, {"author_id": "2100424382883459072", "created_at": "2026-10-30T15:36:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116192617754948047"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/GL8hrbKYMz", "end": 219, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/nerranetwork/status/2116192617754948047/video/1", "media_key": "7_2116192601191731200", "start": 196, "url": "https://t.co/GL8hrbKYMz"}]}, "id": "2116192617754948047", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🎙️ AI Chips &amp; Data Centres Daily · Ep 39\n\nTSMC is weighing a twenty percent CoWoS price hike as packaging stays tight.\n\nFull episode: link in bio, or search Nerra Network in your podcast app. https://t.co/GL8hrbKYMz", "url": "https://x.com/nerranetwork/status/2116192617754948047"}, {"author_id": "2008037126898909184", "created_at": "2026-10-29T02:41:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115635076172263736"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 95, "start": 91, "tag": "TSM"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/azGXCBYiNM", "end": 212, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Jaymin_Alpha/status/2115635076172263736/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115634977148928000", "start": 189, "url": "https://t.co/azGXCBYiNM"}]}, "id": "2115635076172263736", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 579, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "TSMC CoWoS 인상설, 장비 납기 8개월이 공급을 묶는다\n장자루이 | 2026.10.27 | 대만공상시보\n\n1. 가격 인상은 공급망 전망\n- 기사는